# Runs as a player in a faction: every other faction, how yours stands with it, and (for the leader)
# buttons.
execute store result storage monkey:diplomacy me.a int 1 run scoreboard players get @s st.faction
function monkey:diplomacy/menu_head with storage monkey:diplomacy me
